# ARK Operational Certification

**Frozen v3** — [operational-certifications.md](../../docs/product/operational-certifications.md) · [cursor-agent-brief.md](../../docs/product/cursor-agent-brief.md). Do not expand the framework.

## Done means

Real shop work — not feature shipped. Trust bar: *Would I trust this while Molly is helping a customer?*

## PASS levels (dependency chain — not independent badges)

```text
Engineering → Operational → Production
```

If Engineering breaks, Operational and Production **suspend** until Engineering is green again.

## Layers

**Capability** — system can do it. **Operational** — shop can work with it.

## Evidence vs proof

- **Evidence** — what happened (factory-reset VVX, customer call)
- **Proof** — verifiable later (video, screenshot, log, RO #)

## Coarse catalog only (~9)

Front Counter · Bay · Portable Station · Orientation · Voice Transport · Payments · Customer Intake · Inspection · Parts

Do not splinter into dozens of certs.

## Every cert ends with

**Why this matters:** After this certification, the shop can…

## Code review & backlog

> **Which certification does this move forward?**

If none — misaligned work.

